flowchart TB
  U[Person speaking on iPhone] --> UI[SwiftUI Voice Surface]
  UI --> P[Interaction Policy<br/>Swift VoiceInteractionCore]
  UI --> A[Native Audio Controller<br/>AVAudioSession + microphones]
  A --> VAD[Speech & Turn Detection<br/>Acoustic + Semantic + manual]
  VAD --> P
  P -->|typed effects| E[Serialized Effect Runner]
  E -->|audio transport| T[Swappable Voice Adapter]
  T -->|Option A| LIVE[Realtime / GPT-Live via WebRTC]
  T -->|Option B| CHAIN[Apple Speech or STT > Core > TTS]
  E -->|typed app requests| CORE[Single Sovereign Core<br/>Tasks + Policies + Approvals]
  CORE --> MEMORY[(Memory and Task Ledger)]
  CORE --> TOOLS[Allowed tools / services]
  CORE --> REC[Passive Evidence Recorder<br/>append-only]
  REC --> MAC[Encrypted verified export to Mac]
  LIVE -->|events + audio| E
  CHAIN -->|events + audio| E
  E -->|acknowledged audio + state| UI
  CORE -->|receipts and approvals| UI
